  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/EntregaPremisNadalOndaCentreComercial.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La noche de este jueves se han entregado en el sal&oacute;n de actos de la Casa de Cultura los premios de la campa&ntilde;a de Navidad de Onda Centre Comercial, <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=73581\" target=\"_blank\">seg&uacute;n el sorteo celebrado en el Local de Asociaciones la noche del lunes</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entregapremisondacentrecomercial17/img_6525.jpg\" alt=\"img_6525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entregapremisondacentrecomercial17/img_6526.jpg\" alt=\"img_6526\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entregapremisondacentrecomercial17/img_6527.jpg\" alt=\"img_6527\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entregapremisondacentrecomercial17/img_6528.jpg\" alt=\"img_6528\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entregapremisondacentrecomercial17/img_6533.jpg\" alt=\"img_6533\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entregapremisondacentrecomercial17/img_6537.jpg\" alt=\"img_6537\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entregapremisondacentrecomercial17/img_6538.jpg\" alt=\"img_6538\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/entregapremisondacentrecomercial17/img_6540.jpg\" alt=\"img_6540\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd